    "causal_summary": "HVR is enforced by reference: a skill points at a 684-line document and nothing checks the output. With no hooks available and no dependency on the sk-doc packet permitted, enforcement has to come from prevention and review, not interception. This packet builds a standalone HVR integration: an always-loaded card carrying every blocker inline, a self-scan the model must emit, a validator run at review time, and a conciseness layer above HVR.",
